}

Think of "solution" as the list of the m sites you picked — just drop each site identifier in that array, exactly as it appears in the instance. This snippet is only a sketch of the expected shape, not the actual answer.

Please make sure you use the identifiers exactly as they show up in the input — no renaming and no new labels.
